  the path data of Voxt (https://github.com/hehehai/voxt) at commit baa6f31
  (Voxt/Windows/WaveformIconPathData.swift, WaveformIconViews.swift),
  Copyright the Voxt authors, licensed under the Apache License 2.0; the
  paths are unchanged.

Voxt menu bar icon
  internal/trayicon/voxt.png, the microphone of the menu bar icon, is
